    "description": "Launch a coordinating attack with a Bow weapon. This attack gains +3 Acc and -5 Atk. It cannot make Extra Attacks. On hit, the target is Marked. The next allied unit that attacks the Marked target gains Advantage to their attack roll, +3 Atk, +3 Spd and +10 Crit. This Mark only lasts until the end of the current turn.\n\nThis weapon art cannot be used on a target already Marked. Using this weapon art on a different target while another unit is already Marked by you will dispel the existing Mark.",
